<view class="container"><view class="eyebrow">CAMPUS CONNECTIONS</view><view class="title">校园事务，轻松抵达</view><view class="subtitle">学习之外的每件小事，也值得被照顾。</view>
<view class="grid2 services"><view class="service mint" bindtap="go" data-page="rooms"><view class="service-symbol">▦</view><view class="item-title">空教室查询</view><text class="muted">找一个专注的角落 →</text></view><view class="service peach" bindtap="go" data-page="notices"><view class="service-symbol">◉</view><view class="item-title">校园通知</view><text class="muted">不错过重要消息 →</text></view><view class="service blue" bindtap="go" data-page="plan"><view class="service-symbol">▤</view><view class="item-title">培养方案</view><text class="muted">学业进度一目了然 →</text></view><view class="service lilac" bindtap="go" data-page="exams"><view class="service-symbol">◷</view><view class="item-title">考试安排</view><text class="muted">为下一场从容准备 →</text></view></view>
<view class="section">校园常用站点</view><view class="card links"><view wx:for="{{links}}" wx:key="id" class="link-row" bindtap="openLink" data-i="{{index}}"><view class="link-symbol">{{item.icon}}</view><view class="link-main"><view class="item-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.purpose}}</view></view><text class="muted">↗</text></view></view><view class="hint">学校站点提供地址复制入口。小程序内嵌网页需要站点所有者配置业务域名；本站点登录状态由学校管理。</view>
</view>
